PRIMARY SOURCE

The DGFiP (Direction générale des Finances publiques) maintains the
authoritative list of approved platforms (Plateformes Agréées) at:

  https://www.impots.gouv.fr/je-consulte-la-liste-des-plateformes-agreees

This dataset is a structured snapshot derived from that public source,
augmented with editorial enrichments (target personas, integrations,
strengths/weaknesses notes) on a subset of platforms.

DGFiP data itself is in the public domain. The added editorial work
(structuring, enrichment, schema, completion levels) is what is
licensed under CC BY 4.0.

